cted.x} ${g.reflected.y}" stroke="#f6a8de" stroke-width="5" fill="none" marker-mid="url(#light-out-arrow)"/>`:''}<path d="${arc(55,-90-angle,-90)}" stroke="#ffe48a" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/>${reflection?`<path d="${arc(75,-90,-90+angle)}" stroke="#f6a8de" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/>`:''}${surface?`<path d="${arc(100,-180,-90-angle)}" stroke="#8cddd4" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="5 3"/>`:''}${opening&&reflection?`<path d="${arc(123,-90-angle,-90+angle)}" stroke="#b7b6ff" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="5 3"/>`:''}<circle cx="320" cy="245" r="5" fill="#fff"/><path d="M320 227h18v18" stroke="#d6e7ff" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg><figcaption><span class="ray-key incoming">→ 入射光</span><span class="ray-key outgoing">→ 反射光${!reflection?'（予想後に表示）':''}</span><span class="ray-key normal">┊ 法線</span></figcaption><div class="reflection-metrics"><div class="incoming"><span>入射角 · 法線から</span><strong>${hideIncidence&&!answers?'？':m.incidence}°</strong></div><div class="outgoing"><span>反射角 · 法線から</span><strong>${answers?m.reflection:'？'}°</strong></div>${surface?`<div class="surface"><span>鏡の面からの角度</span><strong>${m.surface}°</strong></div>`:''}${opening?`<div class="opening"><span>2本の線の開き</span><strong>${answers?m.opening:'？'}°</strong></div>`:''}</div></figure>`}
-function lightExplanation(r){const m=LightLab.metrics(r.angle);return r.id==='light-surface'?`鏡の面と法線は90°。入射角は 90 − ${m.surface} ＝ ${m.incidence}°。反射角も ${m.reflection}°。`:r.id==='light-opening'?`入射角 ${m.incidence}° ＋ 反射角 ${m.reflection}° ＝ ${m.opening}°。光源側の線と反射光の線が、法線をはさんでつくる角度です。`:`入射角が ${m.incidence}° なら、反射角も ${m.reflection}°。鏡の面ではなく、法線から測ります。`}
